rule:
(1) open with the design worth the most to you;
(2) in each later proposal change at most one decision from your previous proposal,
(3) and only from your top option to your middle option on that decision;
(4) accept only a proposal worth at least 60 points to you; never accept less, and on your last move walk away rather than accept less than 60.

