(1) in your first message, ask the other developer what they need;
(2) accept the first proposal worth at least 40 points to you;
(3) when you propose, build the design around what they said they need and keep only what you must.

(1) make at most one proposal of your own;
(2) do not argue about the design;
(3) after that, accept the other developer's proposal if it is worth at least 30 points to you, otherwise walk away.

